[h1]商店购物车 / Shop Shopping Cart[/h1]
先选商品，再一起结算，让购物车帮你计算总花费和余额。
Select purchases first, review the estimated cost, then check out together.

[h2]功能与操作[/h2]
[list]
[*]卡牌、遗物、药水、删牌服务均可加入购物车；再次点击即可取消。
[*]右侧面板显示购买顺序、预计总额和剩余金币，可拖动、收起；右键购物车图标可恢复默认位置。
[*]已加入购物车、且结算开始时金币足够购买的会员卡会优先购买，后续商品按折扣计算；不会自动选择未加入购物车的会员卡。
[*]轮到删牌时打开原版选牌界面。取消不收删牌费，并停止后续购买；此前已购买的商品不退款。
[*]支持切回原版即点即买。最终价格与效果由原版购买流程决定；购买失败会停止后续商品。
[/list]

[h2]安装与兼容性[/h2]
订阅后等待 Steam 下载，重新启动游戏。无需 BaseLib，也无需额外 PCK。
当前版本 1.0.3；构建和验证环境为 Windows、public-beta 分支、游戏 0.111.0。
订阅版和手动版请保留一种；相同 ID 和版本的手动安装版可能使游戏跳过工坊版。
50 项独立回归和引擎界面检查通过；测试替换了部分界面与同步边界。完整游玩、真实手柄和多人联机仍待实测，其他平台与游戏版本尚未验证。

[h2]English[/h2]
[list]
[*]Add cards, relics, potions and card removal to the cart. Click again to deselect.
[*]A draggable panel shows purchase order, estimated cost and remaining gold. Toggle it using the cart icon; right-click the icon to reset its position.
[*]An already selected Membership Card is purchased first only if affordable when checkout begins. Other items retain their selection order.
[*]Card removal opens the game's selection screen. Cancelling charges no removal fee and stops later purchases without refunding earlier purchases.
[*]Switch to immediate-buy mode from the panel. Checkout uses the game's purchase flow and stops at a failed purchase; estimates may vary with relics or other mods.
[/list]
Subscribe, wait for Steam to download, and restart the game. No BaseLib or PCK required.
Version 1.0.3, built and checked on Windows with game 0.111.0 on public-beta. Keep either the Workshop copy or the same-ID manual copy for testing.
50 isolated regression checks and a separate engine UI check passed. Full gameplay, physical controllers, multiplayer, other game versions and platforms remain unverified.

